## FP-039 — below the $75 receipt threshold (SYN-006 § 3.1)

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp039:
  output computation content E.ExpenseApproval

scope TestFp039:
  definition computation equals
    output of E.ExpenseApproval with {
      -- amount: $50
      -- department: T.Department.Marketing
    }
  assertion computation.approval_level = T.ApprovalLevel.Manager
  assertion computation.receipt_required = false
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp039
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp039 ─
│ computation =
│   ExpenseApproval {
│     -- approval_level: Manager
│     -- receipt_required: false
│   }
└─
```
